<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for Canada/U.S. spring/durum wheat.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for Canada/U.S. spring/durum wheat.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders for a combined cargo of 12,000 tonnes of U.S. or Canadian spring wheat and 6,000 tonnes of U.S. or Canadian durum wheat.</p>
<p>The tender closes October 15 and shipment is November 15-30.</p>
</text>
